WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.870
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.140 --> 00:29.250
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.430 --> 00:32.930
[Episode 9]

4
00:40.110 --> 00:41.430
Your Highness.

5
00:41.430 --> 00:44.240
Are you trying to elope?

6
00:49.960 --> 00:52.640
Isn't this Lord Ning of the Yulin Guard?

7
00:56.390 --> 00:57.050
Don't come any closer,

8
00:57.050 --> 00:58.010
or I'll kill her!

9
00:58.970 --> 00:59.830
Ning Changyue.

10
01:00.710 --> 01:01.750
Cut the crap.

11
01:01.750 --> 01:04.950
Lord Ning, are you trying to hold the princess hostage?

12
01:05.810 --> 01:07.140
Since you've caught us,

13
01:07.600 --> 01:08.590
and I can't take her away alive,

14
01:08.590 --> 01:09.990
then we'll die together!

15
01:12.900 --> 01:14.770
Ning Changyue! Ning Changyue!

16
01:14.800 --> 01:16.050
Let me go!

17
01:22.710 --> 01:25.480
What a tragic drama of star-crossed lovers.

18
01:26.430 --> 01:27.680
In the past,

19
01:27.730 --> 01:29.010
if I were in a good mood,

20
01:29.430 --> 01:31.630
I might have let you two go off together.

21
01:32.150 --> 01:33.400
But now,

22
01:33.950 --> 01:34.789
what a pity.

23
01:37.560 --> 01:39.229
You, a princess out of favor,

24
01:39.229 --> 01:41.090
have caught the eye of General Yu.

25
01:41.400 --> 01:42.710
So today,

26
01:42.789 --> 01:44.870
I have no choice but to be the bad guy

27
01:45.560 --> 01:47.039
who breaks you two

28
01:47.950 --> 01:48.789
apart.

29
01:55.600 --> 01:58.440
Princess Ningjia, receive the edict.

30
02:04.350 --> 02:05.400
By the grace of Heaven,

31
02:05.400 --> 02:06.790
the Emperor decrees:

32
02:06.960 --> 02:09.630
Princess Ningjia is gentle and intelligent.

33
02:09.789 --> 02:12.830
General Yu is unparalleled in loyalty and bravery.

34
02:12.850 --> 02:14.250
They are a perfect match.

35
02:14.510 --> 02:16.130
I hereby grant them marriage,

36
02:16.130 --> 02:19.310
to be wed on the auspicious day, the eighth day of the third lunar month,

37
02:19.310 --> 02:20.910
to show my special favor.

38
02:21.620 --> 02:23.100
Respect this.

39
02:26.050 --> 02:28.400
I won't marry him. I won't marry him.

40
02:28.710 --> 02:30.079
Let me go!

41
02:30.140 --> 02:31.000
Let me go!

42
02:31.000 --> 02:32.280
I won't marry him!

43
02:32.630 --> 02:33.120
Song Yiqiu!

44
02:33.120 --> 02:34.280
Let me go!

45
02:34.280 --> 02:35.590
Let me go!

46
02:35.590 --> 02:36.630
Your Highness, it seems you

47
02:36.630 --> 02:39.430
have been led astray by some scum.

48
03:06.470 --> 03:07.630
Your Highness.

49
03:08.260 --> 03:09.820
Now you know

50
03:09.560 --> 03:15.300
♪ Fate is hard to write, with karma left incomplete ♪

51
03:10.630 --> 03:12.230
what you should do, right?

52
03:15.890 --> 03:22.610
♪ Past lives burn away at dusk, old memories fade cold ♪

53
03:23.430 --> 03:30.020
♪ Across lifetimes, my longing remains, leaving no regret ♪

54
03:30.240 --> 03:37.620
♪ 3,000 years cannot undo the bitterness of one endless cycle ♪

55
03:37.650 --> 03:39.680
♪ Watching time flow ♪

56
03:39.710 --> 03:41.590
♪ Hearing the years sigh softly ♪

57
03:41.610 --> 03:44.370
♪ Immortality still cannot bring fulfillment ♪

58
03:44.400 --> 03:46.560
♪ Let fate tear everything apart ♪

59
03:46.590 --> 03:48.460
♪ Our bond exists only because ♪

60
03:48.480 --> 03:51.590
♪ I don't want to leave regrets behind ♪

61
03:51.970 --> 03:55.760
♪ I'd forsake immortality to share your joys and sorrows ♪

62
03:55.780 --> 03:58.790
♪ Don't ask how absurd the ending may be ♪

63
03:58.829 --> 04:01.110
♪ I only want to use this lifetime ♪

64
04:01.130 --> 04:04.490
♪ To trade it for eternity ♪

65
04:04.520 --> 04:08.120
♪ Could we find our happy ending? ♪

66
04:08.750 --> 04:12.120
A lowly wretch dares to covet royalty.

67
04:12.800 --> 04:15.240
Go back to where you came from.

68
04:16.240 --> 04:17.600
Take this sinner

69
04:19.120 --> 04:20.720
to test the medicine.

70
04:22.190 --> 04:23.240
What are you yelling about?

71
04:23.240 --> 04:23.920
Shut up.

72
04:24.800 --> 04:25.600
Stop yelling.

73
04:26.310 --> 04:27.000
Shut up.

74
04:27.800 --> 04:28.530
Stop crying.

75
04:30.720 --> 04:32.250
I'm talking to him, not you.

76
04:32.310 --> 04:32.870
Hurry up.

77
04:33.070 --> 04:33.510
Hurry.

78
04:36.870 --> 04:37.730
No more crying.

79
04:37.870 --> 04:38.430
Hurry.

80
04:42.120 --> 04:43.850
Stop shouting. Stop shouting.

81
04:44.040 --> 04:44.510
Hurry.

82
04:54.510 --> 04:55.120
Move.

83
04:55.480 --> 04:56.630
Why are you just standing there?

84
04:56.630 --> 04:57.159
Hurry up.

85
05:11.120 --> 05:12.480
Legend has it

86
05:12.480 --> 05:15.560
the Tree Spirit's inner core can bring the dead back to life,

87
05:15.560 --> 05:18.220
restore flesh to bones, and grant immortality.

88
05:18.360 --> 05:19.800
Hand over the inner core,

89
05:21.310 --> 05:23.440
and you won't have to suffer like this.

90
05:30.660 --> 05:32.270
How dare you ignore me.

91
05:32.720 --> 05:34.720
Drain her blood.

92
05:35.120 --> 05:35.800
-Yes. -Yes.

93
06:06.640 --> 06:07.600
Song Yiqiu.

94
06:11.600 --> 06:12.680
Run.

95
06:13.310 --> 06:15.430
Come on.

96
06:15.450 --> 06:17.560
Today is Princess Ningjia's wedding day.

97
06:17.560 --> 06:18.600
This is a gift from the higher-ups.

98
06:18.600 --> 06:19.510
Drink up,

99
06:19.510 --> 06:20.510
and share the joy.

100
06:21.600 --> 06:22.430
Come on.

101
06:24.600 --> 06:25.430
Isn't this

102
06:25.430 --> 06:27.630
Lord Ning, who was beaten half to death?

103
06:29.190 --> 06:30.240
Lord Ning,

104
06:30.510 --> 06:32.170
do you want some wedding wine?

105
06:35.750 --> 06:36.390
Come on.

106
06:36.390 --> 06:37.190
Fill it up for me again.

107
06:37.190 --> 06:39.190
A toad dares to dream of a swan.

108
06:39.630 --> 06:40.600
I haven't felt this good in a long time.

109
06:40.600 --> 06:43.040
The woman you love is marrying someone else.

110
06:43.040 --> 06:44.300
Why aren't you crying?

111
06:46.830 --> 06:48.159
Come on, guys.

112
06:48.159 --> 06:49.600
-Let's drink. -Okay.

113
06:49.600 --> 06:50.720
Come here.

114
06:51.630 --> 06:52.750
Bottoms up.

115
06:53.390 --> 06:54.600
I don't deserve her.

116
06:56.630 --> 06:58.190
I never did.

117
06:59.550 --> 07:01.400
She is the moon in the sky,

118
07:02.840 --> 07:04.600
and I am the mud on the ground.

119
07:09.560 --> 07:10.790
Let's get drunk, bro.

120
07:20.960 --> 07:23.090
Go get a pot of hot tea for the Princess.

121
07:36.080 --> 07:37.840
Your Highness, it's me.

122
07:39.600 --> 07:40.510
Xiaoyuan.

123
07:41.040 --> 07:41.900
Your Highness,

124
07:42.000 --> 07:42.930
there's no time.

125
07:43.240 --> 07:46.270
I'll take you out of the palace according to Lord Ning's backup plan.

126
07:46.270 --> 07:46.920
Xiaoyuan,

127
07:47.320 --> 07:48.180
if they find out

128
07:48.390 --> 07:50.250
you let me go, you'll be beheaded.

129
07:50.920 --> 07:52.050
Lord Ning helped me.

130
07:52.440 --> 07:54.540
His wish is to help you escape the palace.

131
07:54.540 --> 07:56.540
I will also escape during the chaos.

132
07:57.600 --> 07:58.620
Take this identity token

133
07:58.620 --> 08:00.180
and go out through the west corner gate.

134
08:00.180 --> 08:02.180
Lord Ning has arranged everything.

135
08:02.310 --> 08:04.390
The carriage, travel documents, and route

136
08:04.390 --> 08:05.680
are all at the usual place.

137
08:05.680 --> 08:06.480
Your Highness,

138
08:06.480 --> 08:08.090
I calculated the time before I came

139
08:08.090 --> 08:09.970
and left a pile of firewood at the east corner gate.

140
08:09.970 --> 08:11.540
Taking advantage of the chaos caused by the fire,

141
08:11.540 --> 08:13.000
no one will recognize you.

142
08:13.000 --> 08:14.850
Your Highness, go quickly.

143
08:14.880 --> 08:16.790
No, I can't.

144
08:18.470 --> 08:19.330
Your Highness,

145
08:19.830 --> 08:22.780
the world is vast once you escape.

146
08:22.870 --> 08:25.920
I hope your wishes come true.

147
08:31.830 --> 08:33.150
Song Yiqiu,

148
08:34.320 --> 08:35.909
you must escape.

149
08:37.030 --> 08:39.030
The world outside is vast.

150
08:40.150 --> 08:41.360
I hope

151
08:42.750 --> 08:44.600
your wishes come true.

152
08:50.590 --> 08:51.440
Come on.

153
08:52.200 --> 08:53.630
There's a fire!

154
08:53.630 --> 08:54.630
Fire!

155
08:54.630 --> 08:57.000
Somebody help! There's a fire!

156
08:57.000 --> 08:58.720
Fire!

157
08:58.720 --> 09:00.120
Look over there!

158
09:00.240 --> 09:01.270
There really is a fire.

159
09:01.270 --> 09:01.870
Fire!

160
09:02.120 --> 09:02.720
Really!

161
09:02.720 --> 09:04.030
Let me out!

162
09:04.030 --> 09:04.750
Go!

163
09:05.480 --> 09:07.000
Help! Hurry!

164
09:07.510 --> 09:09.150
Don't just stand there. Run!

165
09:11.670 --> 09:12.480
Run!

166
09:14.480 --> 09:15.320
Hurry up!

167
09:16.440 --> 09:17.270
Somebody!

168
09:17.510 --> 09:18.600
Help!

169
09:25.630 --> 09:26.910
Somebody help!

170
09:29.430 --> 09:30.520
The fire is so big.

171
09:31.590 --> 09:33.790
She'll definitely escape in the chaos.

172
09:46.320 --> 09:47.960
Do you know where the prison is?

173
09:47.960 --> 09:49.130
Your Highness, you can't go.

174
09:49.130 --> 09:50.300
That's a dead end.

175
09:53.030 --> 09:54.760
This is also the freedom I want.

176
10:00.020 --> 10:01.140
Song Yiqiu.

177
10:06.010 --> 10:07.730
Let us out!

178
10:07.760 --> 10:09.190
Go! Hurry!

179
10:11.270 --> 10:12.000
Run!

180
10:15.390 --> 10:16.050
Over there!

181
10:26.510 --> 10:28.230
Let us out!

182
10:30.720 --> 10:33.440
Help me! Help me!

183
10:33.740 --> 10:34.910
Please help me!

184
10:35.670 --> 10:37.080
Help!

185
10:38.870 --> 10:40.200
The door is open! Hurry!

186
10:40.200 --> 10:41.030
Run!

187
10:41.030 --> 10:42.120
Run!

188
10:46.120 --> 10:47.120
Help us!

189
10:47.120 --> 10:49.240
Let us out!

190
10:51.150 --> 10:52.120
Hurry! Hurry!

191
11:21.240 --> 11:22.470
Song Yiqiu.

192
11:23.550 --> 11:24.670
Why are you here?

193
11:26.890 --> 11:27.940
Go.

194
11:28.030 --> 11:29.230
Don't worry about me.

195
11:36.080 --> 11:37.720
Let's go. Hurry up.

196
11:38.870 --> 11:39.550
Let's go!

197
11:40.270 --> 11:40.960
Hurry.

198
11:43.480 --> 11:44.480
Let's go!

199
11:46.150 --> 11:47.030
Let's go!

200
11:47.030 --> 11:48.120
I can't walk.

201
11:48.670 --> 11:50.590
You can't leave if you take me.

202
11:51.030 --> 11:53.440
No, no.

203
11:53.440 --> 11:55.120
Leave me alone and go.

204
11:58.010 --> 11:59.010
No.

205
12:22.190 --> 12:23.220
Song Yiqiu.

206
12:24.520 --> 12:26.550
You could have escaped in the chaos.

207
12:29.240 --> 12:30.790
Why did you come back?

208
12:56.390 --> 12:58.240
Our lives have been tied together

209
12:58.240 --> 13:01.390
since you taught me how to draw a bow.

210
13:04.240 --> 13:07.550
If we live, we live together.

211
13:14.160 --> 13:16.710
If we die, we die together.

212
13:58.840 --> 13:59.750
This is...

213
14:01.670 --> 14:03.360
Their bond

214
14:04.450 --> 14:06.780
actually generated a spiritual pill.

215
14:12.080 --> 14:13.200
Eat it.

216
14:18.480 --> 14:19.630
Maybe you can get a chance

217
14:19.630 --> 14:21.510
to be together forever.

218
15:01.780 --> 15:03.270
Pass on my decree:

219
15:03.790 --> 15:05.990
The traitors Ningjia and Ning Changyue

220
15:06.280 --> 15:07.740
released the Tree Spirit.

221
15:08.320 --> 15:09.840
Kill them without mercy!

222
15:13.510 --> 15:14.200
Stop!

223
15:14.390 --> 15:15.080
After them!

224
15:16.670 --> 15:17.360
Over there!

225
15:17.910 --> 15:18.670
Watch out!

226
15:19.510 --> 15:20.630
Hurry! Hyah!

227
15:22.320 --> 15:24.450
That's a cliff. They can't escape now.

228
15:26.520 --> 15:28.120
Let's go! Hurry!

229
15:32.630 --> 15:33.510
Your Highness,

230
15:33.880 --> 15:35.310
this is a dead end.

231
15:35.750 --> 15:37.080
You have nowhere to run.

232
15:57.540 --> 15:58.580
Are you afraid?

233
16:00.560 --> 16:02.020
As long as I'm by your side,

234
16:02.560 --> 16:04.290
I have nothing left to wish for.

235
16:14.670 --> 16:15.510
Song Yiqiu,

236
16:16.360 --> 16:17.630
from this day forward,

237
16:18.910 --> 16:21.310
from the heavens above to the depths below,

238
16:21.320 --> 16:22.780
may it always be you and me,

239
16:23.670 --> 16:24.750
never to part.

240
16:26.550 --> 16:27.510
We

241
16:28.720 --> 16:29.960
will never part.
